L001421	    All experimental results are in close agreement with the corresponding numerical simulations with decoherence.
L001422	    By comparing the simulation results with and without decoherence, we observe that the asymmetry of the subsystem purity $\tilde{P}_{B}$ is mainly due to the decoherence.
L001423	    }
L001424	\label{Fig_PSFF1}
L001425	
L001426	\end{figure*}
